     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem extended-content-codes</b></p><a name=\"extended-content-codes\"> </a><a name=\"hcextended-content-codes\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://who.int/cg/CodeSystem/extended-content-codes</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Minor surgery without immobilization<a name=\"extended-content-codes-Minorsurgerywithoutimmobilization\"> </a></td><td>Minor surgery without immobilization</td><td>Minor surgery without immobilization</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Diabetes &gt;20 years duration<a name=\"extended-content-codes-Diabetes.6220yearsduration\"> </a></td><td>Diabetes &gt;20 years duration</td><td>Diabetes &gt;20 years duration</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Other vascular disease &gt;20 years duration<a name=\"extended-content-codes-Othervasculardisease.6220yearsduration\"> </a></td><td>Other vascular disease &gt;20 years duration</td><td>Other vascular disease &gt;20 years duration</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Cigarettes smoked per day<a name=\"extended-content-codes-Cigarettessmokedperday\"> </a></td><td>Cigarettes smoked per day</td><td>Cigarettes smoked per day</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Complicated Valvular heart disease<a name=\"extended-content-codes-ComplicatedValvularheartdisease\"> </a></td><td>Complicated Valvular heart disease</td><td>Complicated Valvular heart disease</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Uncomplicated Valvular heart disease<a name=\"extended-content-codes-UncomplicatedValvularheartdisease\"> </a></td><td>Uncomplicated Valvular heart disease</td><td>Uncomplicated Valvular heart disease</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Tuberculosis - Non-pelvic<a name=\"extended-content-codes-Tuberculosis-Non-pelvic\"> </a></td><td>Tuberculosis - Non-pelvic</td><td>Tuberculosis - Non-pelvic</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Broad-spectrum antibiotics<a name=\"extended-content-codes-Broad-spectrumantibiotics\"> </a></td><td>Broad-spectrum antibiotics</td><td>Medications - Broad-spectrum antibiotics</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Backup Method Needed<a name=\"extended-content-codes-BackupMethodNeeded\"> </a></td><td>Backup contraception method needed</td><td>Backup contraception method needed</td></tr></table></div>"
